# Copy to navidrome.yml and put in oi-o-mat's Tailscale name. Navidrome listens on the Tailscale address itself, plain
# http; Tonregal's navidrome.toml switches its /metrics on ([Prometheus] Enabled).
- targets: [oi-o-mat.example.ts.net:4533]
  labels:
    app: navidrome
    __scheme__: http
    __metrics_path__: /metrics
